    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWonderfully located C. 0.8 acre site in a peaceful rural setting for sale subject to planning permission (local need applies).\n\nDNG McCormack Quinn are delighted to present this C. 0.8 acre site located in a scenic countryside setting between the Villages of Monamolin and Raheenduff.\n\nThis rectangular plot of land, Folio WX11035, is accessed at the top corner of the site. Enjoying an idyllic rural setting, it is only minutes from essential local amenities and the R741 Gorey to Wexford Road. \n\nMonamolin is a popular rural Village in the heart of the County with a national school, local pub, and sporting facilities. The nearby Towns of Gorey and Enniscorthy are approximately 15-20 minutes away, while the M11 motorway can be accessed from Gorey and provides a convenient route to Dublin. Morriscastle beach is just a 15 minute drive.\n\nDirections; From Wexford, proceed out through Castlebridge on the R741, continue for 16 kms and turn left for Raheenduff. Proceed straight through the crossroads in Raheenduff and take the first turn to the right. Continue on this road for 1.4 kms and the site is on the right hand side marked with a For Sale board."
      },
      {
